*Tool Used: Amazon QuickSight*  *Project Title: Providing Data Insights to a Community College* 

Project Overview 

This  project  simulates  a  real-world  business  intelligence  workflow  using  Amazon QuickSight  and  Amazon  Q  to  support  a  fictional  community  college  in  understanding 
student  enrollment  patterns.  The  goal  was  to  create,  configure,  and  analyze  a  dataset, build  interactive  visuals,  and  develop  a  data-driven  story  that  could  inform  strategic 
decisions for improving student satisfaction without increasing costs. 

Sample Topic Setup 

The  first  step  was  to  create  a  sample  topic  titled  Student  Enrollment  .  This  process  took 
several  minutes  to  initialize.  Once  completed,  the  topic  served  as  a  foundation  for 
exploring student data using Amazon Q. 
